{"4400890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ratfall", "steam_appid": 4400890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/2767f75a702198d817f6bb450966ddac.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1280 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>RATFALL</strong>™, you and other players drop into a nightmare of rusted pipes, broken valves, spinning blades, crushing machinery, and toxic sludge. The only rule is simple: <strong>keep falling, keep moving, and don’t die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one rat will make it out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match throws you into a vertical descent through filthy, claustrophobic sewer tunnels packed with hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll fall through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrow pipe shafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flooded chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rusty maintenance tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial trap zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the deadlier it gets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is all about timing, movement, and quick reactions. One mistake is enough to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushing pistons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotating saws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam vents and pressure blasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes, grinders, and broken machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsing platforms and sudden drops</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a cozy co-op adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall alongside other rats and do whatever it takes to survive longer than everyone else. Push past them, bait them into traps, or simply stay calm while the others panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every match:<br><strong>only one rat wins.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RATFALL</strong>™ is built with gritty pixel-art visuals, thick atmosphere, and a sewer aesthetic that feels alive and hostile.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, moody pixel environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Readable hazards and fast action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying movement and clean controls</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/2767f75a702198d817f6bb450966ddac.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1280 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>RATFALL</strong>™, you and other players drop into a nightmare of rusted pipes, broken valves, spinning blades, crushing machinery, and toxic sludge. The only rule is simple: <strong>keep falling, keep moving, and don’t die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one rat will make it out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/140bfc4dc6f746b4eed83871d031b4b0.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match throws you into a vertical descent through filthy, claustrophobic sewer tunnels packed with hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll fall through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrow pipe shafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flooded chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rusty maintenance tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial trap zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the deadlier it gets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/f466fa1077188ea308a8ffb8a0d37c44.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is all about timing, movement, and quick reactions. One mistake is enough to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushing pistons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotating saws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam vents and pressure blasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes, grinders, and broken machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsing platforms and sudden drops</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/0e0d1db5ede20d7663ab7a35ef861a99.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a cozy co-op adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall alongside other rats and do whatever it takes to survive longer than everyone else. Push past them, bait them into traps, or simply stay calm while the others panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every match:<br><strong>only one rat wins.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.poster.avif?t=1772293994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.webm?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/extras/38883f91dee4e933f104a76f86f4c9f3.mp4?t=1772293994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RATFALL</strong>™ is built with gritty pixel-art visuals, thick atmosphere, and a sewer aesthetic that feels alive and hostile.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, moody pixel environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Readable hazards and fast action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying movement and clean controls</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A chaotic multiplayer platformer where you play as a rat falling downward with friends, dodging deadly traps, bumping into each other, and fighting to survive the longest in fast-paced rounds.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/9162e3b3a23d1a431172a46cc878eb07c4c8d4af/header.jpg?t=1772293994", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/e03457d6a32a0a569a15818aea7a8ff92fb89ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772293994", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400890/e03457d6a32a0a569a15818aea7a8ff92fb89ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772293994", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X / Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compliant</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><st